<title>UK: Lonrho - Craven to succeed Leahy as chairman.</title>
<headline>Lonrho - Craven to succeed Leahy as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British conglomerate Lonrho Plc said on Friday that John Craven would take over as chairman from John Leahy after the annual general meeting on March 26.</p>
<p>Lonrho said in a statement Craven has been appointed as a non-executive director with immediate effect.  </p>
<p>A spokesman for Lonrho said Craven was currently non-executive chairman at Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, a unit of Deutsche Bank AG.     -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 401</p>
